    "6d757384871c4250f69d1b844428bdc182da6e9a8b567a918b4e86f86b405a4b": {
      "normalizationVersion": 1,
      "sourceHash": "2f6939e3a812ebac080b17de5830b0cf03d542bbbf7d5f6d6a373c5c6bd60e18",
      "contextFingerprint": "1b10001bab30f2dc5115677aa66067223e4582ea3c52218edb91c70a6d9f6ece",
      "sourceText": "*   **name** （可选）：指定link名称，此名称会映射为同名坐标系，还可以通过引用该值定位定位link。\n\n*   **<geometry>** （必填）：用于设置link的形状，比如：立方体、球体或圆柱。\n\n    *   **<box>** ：立方体标签，通过size属性设置立方体的边长，原点为其几何中心。\n\n    *   **<cylinder>** ：圆柱标签，通过radius属性设置圆柱半径，通过length属性设置圆柱高度，原点为其几何中心。\n\n    *   **<sphere>** ：球体标签，通过radius属性设置球体半径，原点为其几何中心。\n\n    *   **<mesh>** ：通过属性filename引用“皮肤”文件，为link设置外观，该文件必须是本地文件。使用 package://<packagename>/<path>为文件名添加前缀。\n\n    *   **<origin>** （可选）：用于设置link的相对偏移量以及旋转角度，如未指定则使用默认值（无偏移且无旋转）。\n\n        *   **xyz** ：表示x、y、z三个维度上的偏移量（以米为单位），不同数值之间使用空格分隔，如未指定则使用默认值（三个维度无偏移）。\n\n        *   **rpy** ：表示翻滚、俯仰与偏航的角度（以弧度为单位），不同数值之间使用空格分隔，如未指定则使用默认值（三个维度无旋转）。\n\n    *   **<material>** （可选）：视觉元素的材质。也可以在根标签robot中定义material标签，然后，可以在link中按名称进行引用。\n\n        *   **name** （可选）：为material指定名称，可以通过该值进行引用。\n\n        *   **<color>** （可选）：rgba 材质的颜色，由代表red/green/blue/alpha 的四个数字组成，每个数字的范围为 \\[0,1\\]。\n\n        *   **<texture>** （可选）：材质的纹理，可以由属性filename设置。",
      "translatedText": "*   **name** (Optional): Specifies the link name\\. This name is mapped to a coordinate frame with the same name and can also be used to locate the link by referencing this value\\.\n\n*   **<geometry>** (Required): Used to set the shape of the link, such as a cube, sphere, or cylinder\\.\n\n    *   **<box>** : Cube tag\\. The side length of the cube is set via the size attribute, with its origin at the geometric center\\.\n\n    *   **<cylinder>** : Cylinder tag\\. The cylinder radius is set via the radius attribute, and the cylinder height is set via the length attribute, with its origin at the geometric center\\.\n\n    *   **<sphere>** : Sphere tag\\. The sphere radius is set via the radius attribute, with its origin at the geometric center\\.\n\n    *   **<mesh>** : References a \"skin\" file via the filename attribute to set the appearance of the link\\. The file must be a local file\\. Use package://<packagename>/<path>as a prefix for the filename\\.\n\n    *   **<origin>** (Optional): Used to set the relative offset and rotation angle of the link\\. If not specified, default values are used (no offset and no rotation)\\.\n\n        *   **xyz** : Represents the offset in the three dimensions x, y, and z (in meters)\\. Separate different values with spaces\\. If not specified, the default value is used (no offset in any of the three dimensions)\\.\n\n        *   **rpy** : Represents the roll, pitch, and yaw angles (in radians)\\. Separate different values with spaces\\. If not specified, the default value is used (no rotation in any of the three dimensions)\\.\n\n    *   **<material>** (Optional): The material of the visual element\\. A material tag can also be defined in the root robot tag and then referenced by name within a link\\.\n\n        *   **name** (Optional): Specifies a name for the material, which can be referenced via this value\\.\n\n        *   **<color>** (Optional): The color of the rgba material, consisting of four numbers representing red/green/blue/alpha, with each number ranging from \\[0,1\\]\\.\n\n        *   **<texture>** (Optional): The texture of the material, which can be set via the filename attribute\\.",
